# 💬 Customer Support RAG Bot

An intelligent customer support chatbot powered by Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) that provides accurate, context-grounded responses from a knowledge base.

## 🚀 Live Demo
[Click here to try the bot](https://customer-support-rag-bot-ke4s8u9wbpnufyderssn7r.streamlit.app/)

## 🎯 Problem Statement
Traditional chatbots hallucinate — they give confident but wrong answers. This bot answers ONLY from a verified FAQ knowledge base, reducing hallucination to near zero.

## 🏗️ Architecture
User Query → HuggingFace Embeddings → ChromaDB Semantic Search → Top 3 Chunks Retrieved → Groq LLaMA 3.3 70B → Grounded Answer

## ⚙️ Tech Stack
- **LangChain** — RAG pipeline orchestration
- **ChromaDB** — Vector database for semantic search
- **HuggingFace** — sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 embeddings
- **Groq + LLaMA 3.3 70B** — Fast LLM inference
- **Streamlit** — Interactive web app deployment
- **Python** — Core language

## ✨ Features
- Semantic search over FAQ knowledge base
- Zero hallucination via context-grounded responses
- Source document attribution
- Real-time query answering
- Interactive chat interface

## 📁 Project Structure
```
customer-support-rag-bot/
├── app.py           ← Streamlit frontend
├── rag_chain.py     ← RAG pipeline logic
├── ingest.py        ← Data ingestion script
├── requirements.txt ← Dependencies
└── data/
    └── faq.txt      ← Knowledge base
```

## 🔧 Run Locally

1. Clone the repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/bhardwajrenuka94/Customer-Support-Rag-Bot.git
```

2. Install dependencies
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

3. Add your API key in `.env` file
```
GROQ_API_KEY=your_key_here
```

4. Ingest data
```bash
python ingest.py
```

5. Run the app
```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

